AngularSendIntent *-- ReplyInput
AngularSendIntent ..> AcceptedCommand : invoke receipt only
AngularSendIntent --> PendingSend : Tick Command
PendingSend *-- CreatePostBody
CreatePostBody *-- UserSnapshot
PendingSend --> LocalMessageRow : P1 and terminal writes
CreatePostBody --> RemotePost : POST posts create
RemotePost --> RemoteChannelAggregate : same PG transaction
RemotePost --> RemoteChannelMember : same PG transaction
RemotePost --> RemoteChannelEvent : allocates eventSeq
RemoteChannelEvent --> DeliveryOutbox : durable delivery
DeliveryOutbox --> WsPost : publishes post
WsPost --> PendingSend : temporaryId reconcile
LocalMessageRow --> InteractionFrameV2 : readback projector
InteractionFrameV2 *-- InteractionRuntimeVm
InteractionFrameV2 *-- SurfaceMutationV2
SurfaceMutationV2 --> TimelineWindowVm : CURRENT G01
SurfaceMutationV2 ..> DialogListVm : TARGET when changed
SurfaceMutationV2 ..> UnreadSummaryVm : TARGET when changed
SurfaceMutationV2 ..> ComposerVm : TARGET when changed
TimelineWindowVm *-- MessageVm
MessageVm *-- DeliveryVm
DialogListVm *-- DialogRowVm
DialogRowVm o-- ActionBinding
ComposerVm o-- ActionBinding
InteractionFrameV2 --> SurfaceRuntimeSlot : atomic stage and swap
SurfaceRuntimeSlot --> FrameApplied : post commit ack
SurfaceRuntimeSlot --> DomEvidence : mechanical render

note for PendingSend "CURRENT: in-memory HashMap aggregate, not a SQLite table"
note for InteractionFrameV2 "ChannelFrame is not a second protocol type; channel-derived surfaces share this V2 envelope"
note for SurfaceMutationV2 "CURRENT G01 strict matrix declares message.timeline only; dotted relations are impact targets, not claimed implementation"
note for RemotePost "Fields are the exact post_write columns in message_commit_fast.go, not every column of the global post schema"
